   "description": "Khung môn học theo syllabus FLM chính thức.",
   "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">SCM302 · Section 0 · Lesson 0.4</span>\n<h2>Textbooks, materials & tools the university names</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Main textbooks: <strong>AE Purchasing and Supply Chain Management</strong>; <strong>Module Global Purchasing, Fiata Higher Diploma in Freight Forwarding<br><br><a href=\"https://eresources.fpt.edu.vn/items/4695/views/12296\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://eresources.fpt.edu.vn/items/4695/views/12296</a></strong>.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM · Syllabus ID 14241 · Decision 444/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 23/04/2026 · collected 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">SCM302 · Mục 0 · Bài 0.4</span>\n<h2>Giáo trình, tài liệu & công cụ trường quy định</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Giáo trình chính: <strong>AE Purchasing and Supply Chain Management</strong>; <strong>Module Global Purchasing, Fiata Higher Diploma in Freight Forwarding<br><br><a href=\"https://eresources.fpt.edu.vn/items/4695/views/12296\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://eresources.fpt.edu.vn/items/4695/views/12296</a></strong>.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: FLM · Syllabus ID 14241 · QĐ 444/QĐ-ĐHFPT ngày 23/04/2026 · thu ngày 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<table>\n  <thead><tr><th>#</th><th>Material<br><small>Tài liệu</small></th><th>Author<br><small>Tác giả</small></th><th>Publisher<br><small>NXB</small></th><th>Year<br><small>Năm</small></th><th>Edition<br><small>Lần xuất bản</small></th><th>ISBN</th><th>Main<br><small>Chính</small></th><th>Hard copy<br><small>Bản in</small></th><th>Online</th><th>Note<br><small>Ghi chú</small></th></tr></thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr><td>1</td><td><strong>AE Purchasing and Supply Chain Management</strong></td><td>Robert M. Monczka, Robert B. Handfield, Larry C. Giunipero, James L. Patterson</td><td>Cengage Learning</td><td>2020</td><td>7th</td><td><code>ISBN-13: 9789814922821</code></td><td>✔</td><td>✔</td><td>—</td><td></td></tr>\n    <tr><td>2</td><td><strong>All learning materials can be found on the Coursera website.<br>Course 1: Procurement &amp; Sourcing Introduction <a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/learn/procurement-sourcing-introduction\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/learn/procurement-sourcing-introduction</a><br>Course 2: Procurement Basics<br><a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/learn/procurement-basics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/learn/procurement-basics</a><br>Course 3: Strategic Sourcing<br><a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/learn/strategic-sourcing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/learn/strategic-sourcing</a><br>Course 4: Supplier Management<br><a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/learn/supplier-management\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/learn/supplier-management</a><br>Course 5: Supply Market Analysis<br><a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/learn/supply-market-analysis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/learn/supply-market-analysis</a><br>Course 6: Procurement Negotiation<br><a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/learn/procurement-negotiation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/learn/procurement-negotiation</a><br>Course 7: Strategic Procurement and Sourcing Conclusions<br><a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/learn/procurement-sourcing-conclusions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/learn/procurement-sourcing-conclusions</a></strong></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td></td></tr>\n    <tr><td>3</td><td><strong>Module Global Purchasing, Fiata Higher Diploma in Freight Forwarding<br><br><a href=\"https://eresources.fpt.edu.vn/items/4695/views/12296\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://eresources.fpt.edu.vn/items/4695/views/12296</a></strong></td><td></td><td>FIATA - VLA - VLI</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>✔</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td></td></tr>\n    <tr><td>4</td><td><strong>All learning materials can be found on the Coursera website.<br>MOOC 01: IS/IT Governance<br><a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/learn/is-it-governance\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/learn/is-it-governance</a><br>MOOC 02: Analysis for Business Systems<br><a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/learn/analysis-for-business-systems\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/learn/analysis-for-business-systems</a><br>MOOC 03: Enterprise Systems<br><a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/learn/enterprise-systems\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/learn/enterprise-systems</a><br>MOOC 04: IT Infrastructure and Emerging Trends<br><a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/learn/it-infrastructure-and-emerging-trends\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/learn/it-infrastructure-and-emerging-trends</a></strong></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td></td></tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Tools</h3>\n<p>- Internet</p>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\">Materials with no author/ISBN (slides, exercise packs…) are usually internal files you download inside FLM with your FPT account. Buy the exact <strong>edition</strong> listed — page and exercise numbers change between editions.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Công cụ</h3>\n<p>- Internet</p>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\">Tài liệu không có tác giả/ISBN (slide, bộ bài tập…) thường là file nội bộ, tải trong FLM bằng tài khoản FPT. Mua đúng <strong>lần xuất bản</strong> ghi trong bảng — số trang, số bài tập đổi giữa các bản.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=14241\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=14241</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=14241\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=14241</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
